{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03788","headline":"大酺 · 杜审言","name":"大酺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"毘陵震泽九州通，士女欢娱万国同。\n伐鼓撞钟惊海上，新妆袨服照江东。\n梅花落处疑残雪，柳叶开时任好风。\n火德云官逢道泰，天长地久属年丰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜审言","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03788.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03788","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}